---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Data sources | Better Zamboanga City" description="Find public record directories, source credits, and the correction path for Better Zamboanga City.">
  <section class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 max-w-3xl w-full space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900">Data sources</h1>
    <p>This portal presents public information in searchable directories. Source credits appear on the relevant pages.</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
      <li><a href="/government/barangays" class="text-blue-700 underline">Barangay directory</a> — barangay profiles, officials, and population records.</li>
      <li><a href="/zamboanga-city/officials" class="text-blue-700 underline">City officials</a> — historical election records credited to OpenHalalan.</li>
      <li><a href="/zamboanga-city/house-of-representatives" class="text-blue-700 underline">House of Representatives</a> — member profiles and legislative records.</li>
      <li><a href="/ordinances/regulatory-ordinances" class="text-blue-700 underline">Ordinances</a> — records with links to Ley De Zamboanga.</li>
      <li><a href="/zamboanga-city/flood-control" class="text-blue-700 underline">Flood control projects</a> — project records with source credits.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Coverage and update times vary. A record shown here does not establish that it is complete or current. Check the cited source and responsible agency before relying on it.</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/BetterZamboangaCity-org/betterzamboangacity/issues" class="text-blue-700 underline">Report a data correction in the project repository</a>. Include a public source when available.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
